{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bfb15b3-db0e-11ef-827c-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bfb1595-db0e-11ef-9632-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"曲阜","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魯侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁侯","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b99fe950-db0e-11ef-9630-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"伯禽","people_name_jianti_auto":"伯禽","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b99fe951-db0e-11ef-aed9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b99fe952-db0e-11ef-92af-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","place_note":"山东省曲阜市","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b99fe953-db0e-11ef-a8c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","place_note":"山东省曲阜市","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b99fe954-db0e-11ef-9d32-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯城","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁城","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b99fe955-db0e-11ef-8185-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b99fe956-db0e-11ef-b541-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜县","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b99fe957-db0e-11ef-90bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兗州","place_name_jianti_auto":"兖州","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b99fe958-db0e-11ef-975c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"曲阜，魯侯伯禽所都。應劭云：曲阜在魯城中，委曲長七八里；隋始置曲阜縣，屬兗州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"曲阜，鲁侯伯禽所都。应劭云：曲阜在鲁城中，委曲长七八里；隋始置曲阜县，属兖州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b99fe94f-db0e-11ef-bf8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"亳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"亳州","place_note":"安徽省亳州市","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b99fe95b-db0e-11ef-8f62-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"谷陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"谷阳县","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b99fe95c-db0e-11ef-a369-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b99fe95d-db0e-11ef-8ad1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"苦縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"苦县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b99fe95e-db0e-11ef-95f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"老子祠","place_name_jianti_auto":"老子祠","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b99fe95f-db0e-11ef-a49b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"眞源縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"真源县","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b99fe960-db0e-11ef-8c4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"亳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"亳州","place_note":"安徽省亳州市","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b99fe961-db0e-11ef-9f25-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","place_note":"洛阳","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b99fe962-db0e-11ef-a358-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"亳州谷陽縣，漢苦縣也，有老子祠，是年，改爲眞源縣。亳州至東都八百九十八里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"亳州谷阳县，汉苦县也，有老子祠，是年，改为真源县。亳州至东都八百九十八里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"b99fe95a-db0e-11ef-9ea9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","place_note":"洛阳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b99fe964-db0e-11ef-9d3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","place_note":"西安","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b99fe965-db0e-11ef-a888-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"東都至京師八百五十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"东都至京师八百五十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"b99fe963-db0e-11ef-86ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","place_note":"山东省曲阜市","resolved_place_entity_id":4723,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b99fe967-db0e-11ef-97c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、兖州府（卷三十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"开元十三年，亦幸曲阜，至孔子宅致祭。五代周广顺二年，如曲...","context_before":"...二年，幸鲁，祀孔子于阙里。延光二年，亦幸鲁。隋曰曲阜县。","source_end_index":218,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3af32d51-525d-5f66-8f8c-ac2f4c3cbd8d","source_start_index":205,"source_text":"唐乾封元年，至曲阜祀孔子。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/二、兖州府（卷三十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"丙戌，車駕發泰山；辛卯，至曲阜，贈孔子太師，以少牢致祭。癸未，至亳州，謁老君廟，上尊號曰太上玄元皇帝。丁丑，至東都，留六日；甲申，幸合璧宮；夏，四月，甲辰，至京師，謁太廟。","content_fanyi":"丙戌日，皇帝从泰山出发；辛卯日，抵达曲阜，追赠孔子太师之号，并以少牢之礼祭祀。癸未日，到达亳州，拜谒老君庙，给老子上尊号为太上玄元皇帝。丁丑日，到达东都洛阳，停留六天；甲申日，前往合璧宫；夏季四月甲辰日，回到京师长安，拜谒太庙。","content_jianti_auto":"丙戌，车驾发泰山；辛卯，至曲阜，赠孔子太师，以少牢致祭。癸未，至亳州，谒老君庙，上尊号曰太上玄元皇帝。丁丑，至东都，留六日；甲申，幸合璧宫；夏，四月，甲辰，至京师，谒太庙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19736,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一 (唐紀十七) / 高宗天皇大聖大弘孝皇帝中之上 / 乾封元年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b99fe94e-db0e-11ef-9536-a0d3651f611f","year_int":666},"tongjian_id":"b99fe94e-db0e-11ef-9536-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"曲阜","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"少皞氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"少皞氏","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77b4-db0e-11ef-a742-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魯侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁侯","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77b5-db0e-11ef-add2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"伯禽","people_name_jianti_auto":"伯禽","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77b6-db0e-11ef-a7aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"少皞氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"少皞氏","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77b7-db0e-11ef-8b82-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77b8-db0e-11ef-a797-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉昫","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘昫","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77b9-db0e-11ef-9af9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77ba-db0e-11ef-929d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"窮桑","place_name_jianti_auto":"穷桑","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77bb-db0e-11ef-923a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77bc-db0e-11ef-8a20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77bd-db0e-11ef-bb0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯城","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁城","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77be-db0e-11ef-add1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77bf-db0e-11ef-9a95-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"闕里","place_name_jianti_auto":"阙里","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c0-db0e-11ef-b360-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"孔子祠","place_name_jianti_auto":"孔子祠","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c1-db0e-11ef-86cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c2-db0e-11ef-b11f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兗州","place_name_jianti_auto":"兖州","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c3-db0e-11ef-92d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瑕丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"瑕丘","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c4-db0e-11ef-9cbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c5-db0e-11ef-a617-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c6-db0e-11ef-baf9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c7-db0e-11ef-ace7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"仙源縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"仙源县","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77c8-db0e-11ef-8b8f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"昔少皞氏自窮桑而徙曲阜；魯侯伯禽所宅，少皞氏之墟也。應劭曰：曲阜在魯城中，委曲長七八里。劉昫曰：曲阜有闕里，孔子所居，後人立孔子祠。自唐以來，兗州治瑕丘，而曲阜爲屬縣。九域志：在州東四十里。宋大中祥符五年，改曲阜爲仙源縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"昔少皞氏自穷桑而徙曲阜；鲁侯伯禽所宅，少皞氏之墟也。应劭曰：曲阜在鲁城中，委曲长七八里。刘昫曰：曲阜有阙里，孔子所居，后人立孔子祠。自唐以来，兖州治瑕丘，而曲阜为属县。九域志：在州东四十里。宋大中祥符五年，改曲阜为仙源县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ce6b689b-db0e-11ef-8b80-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"孔子廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"孔子庙","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77cb-db0e-11ef-8f44-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜城","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜城","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77cc-db0e-11ef-a66e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"闕里","place_name_jianti_auto":"阙里","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77cd-db0e-11ef-b8dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"孔子墓","place_name_jianti_auto":"孔子墓","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77ce-db0e-11ef-9f8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77cf-db0e-11ef-b84c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泗水","place_name_jianti_auto":"泗水","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77d0-db0e-11ef-b9ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77d1-db0e-11ef-9c5f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孔子廟在曲阜城西南隅闕里。孔子墓在曲阜城北泗水上，去城一里，葬地蓋一頃，墳南北十步，東西十三步，高一丈二尺，前有瓴甋，爲祠壇，方六尺，與地平。塋中異木以百數，皆諸弟子自四方致之，植於塋中，魯人莫之識也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孔子庙在曲阜城西南隅阙里。孔子墓在曲阜城北泗水上，去城一里，葬地盖一顷，坟南北十步，东西十三步，高一丈二尺，前有瓴甋，为祠坛，方六尺，与地平。茔中异木以百数，皆诸弟子自四方致之，植于茔中，鲁人莫之识也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77ca-db0e-11ef-ab08-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","resolved_place_entity_id":4723,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77d2-db0e-11ef-bc01-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲阜","resolved_place_entity_id":4723,"start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"ce6d77db-db0e-11ef-baab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、兖州府（卷三十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋大中祥符初，亦幸曲阜，谒孔子庙，遂幸孔林。是也。历宋至...","context_before":"...元年，至曲阜祀孔子。开元十三年，亦幸曲阜，至孔子宅致祭。","source_end_index":253,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3af32d51-525d-5f66-8f8c-ac2f4c3cbd8d","source_start_index":236,"source_text":"五代周广顺二年，如曲阜，谒孔子祠。"},{"context_after":"宋真宗亦幸焉。今汉、唐以来碑碣，多有存者。阙里东南为汉鲁...","context_before":"...帝至后汉光武、明、章诸帝，皆幸焉。唐高宗至玄宗，亦幸此。","source_end_index":151,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"0ce7cf21-3461-5146-8897-ec5ffe9671d2","source_start_index":123,"source_text":"五代周世宗谒孔子祠，又拜孔子墓，命葺孔子祠，禁孔林樵采。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/二、兖州府（卷三十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"16六月，乙酉朔，帝如曲阜，謁孔子祠。旣奠，將拜。左右曰：「孔子，陪臣也，不當以天子拜之。」帝曰：「孔子百世帝王之師，敢不敬乎！」遂拜之。又拜孔子墓，命葺孔子祠，禁孔林樵采。訪孔子、顏淵之後，以爲曲阜令及主簿。丙戌，帝發兗州。","content_fanyi":"六月初一日乙酉，后周太祖前往曲阜，拜谒孔子庙。献上祭品以后，将要下拜。左右的人说：“孔子只是诸侯的陪臣，不应当以天子的身份向他下拜。”后周太祖说：“孔子是百世帝王的老师，怎敢不尊敬呢！”于是向他下拜。又拜孔子墓，下令整修孔子祠，禁止在孔林打柴采草。寻访孔子、颜渊的后代，任命他们为曲阜县令和主簿。六月初二日丙戌，后周太祖从兖州出发。","content_jianti_auto":"16六月，乙酉朔，帝如曲阜，谒孔子祠。既奠，将拜。左右曰：「孔子，陪臣也，不当以天子拜之。」帝曰：「孔子百世帝王之师，敢不敬乎！」遂拜之。又拜孔子墓，命葺孔子祠，禁孔林樵采。访孔子、颜渊之后，以为曲阜令及主簿。丙戌，帝发兖州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":30503,"number":16,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百九十 (後周紀一) / 太祖聖神恭肅文武孝皇帝上 / 二年 / 第 27 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"ce6b689a-db0e-11ef-ac35-a0d3651f611f","year_int":952},"tongjian_id":"ce6b689a-db0e-11ef-ac35-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"place_name":"曲阜"},"message":"success","success":true}